  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ブヨンブヨンの　からだを　のびちぢみさせると　おなかの　へそダイナモが！\u0003\u0007大電力だいでんりょく大電力を　はっせいさせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "말랑말랑한 몸을 늘였다 줄였다 하면 배에 달린 배꼽 발전기가 큰 전력을 발생시킨다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "只要伸縮肥嘟嘟的身體，就能讓肚子上的發電臍產生大量的電氣。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsque ce Pokémon allonge et contracte son corps élastique, son nombril-dynamo produit une quantité d’électricité colossale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dehnt und kontrahiert es seinen elastischen Körper, erzeugt der Nabeldynamo in seinem Bauch große Mengen an Elektrizität.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede generar grandes cantidades de energía expandiendo y contrayendo su elástico cuerpo gracias a la dinamo de su ombligo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Allunga e comprime il proprio corpo elastico per generare una gran quantità di elettricità con la dinamo dell’ombelico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When this Pokémon expands and contracts its wobbly body, the belly-button dynamo in its stomach produces a huge amount of electricity.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ブヨンブヨンの　体を　伸び縮みさせると　お腹の　へそダイナモが！\u0003\u0007大電力だいでんりょく大電力を　発生させる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "只要伸缩胖嘟嘟的身体，就能让肚子上的发电脐产生大量的电气。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede generar grandes cantidades de energía expandiendo y contrayendo su elástico cuerpo gracias a la dinamo de su ombligo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "めだまに　みえるが　じつは　おなかのへそダイナモで　つくった　でんきをうちだす　ほうでんきかんなのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "눈알처럼 보이는 것은 사실, 배에 달린 배꼽 발전기로 만들어 낸 전기를 발사하는 방전 기관이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "看似眼球的部位其實是放電器官，能夠用來發射腹部的發電臍製造的電力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses organes semblables à des yeux servent à projeter l’électricité produite par son nombril-dynamo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Was aussieht wie Augen, sind eigentlich Organe, durch die es die Elektrizität entlädt, die es mit dem Nabeldynamo in seinem Bauch erzeugt hat.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los órganos que parecen ojos sirven en realidad para descargar toda la electricidad generada por la dinamo de su ombligo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quelli che sembrano bulbi oculari sono in realtà degli organi in grado di scaricare l’energia generata dalla dinamo dell’ombelico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "What appear to be eyeballs are actually organs for discharging the electricity generated by Bellibolt’s belly-button dynamo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "目玉に　見えるが　じつは　お腹のへそダイナモで　作った　電気を撃ちだす　放電器官なのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "看似眼球的部位其实是放电器官，能够用来发射腹部的发电脐所制造的电力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los órganos que parecen ojos sirven en realidad para descargar toda la electricidad generada por la dinamo de su ombligo.",
      "language": {
